l515: $ … ⇒ dt u (mcv H) ⟨ kc_app , te4 +: tmj +: ∅ ⟩ w r = dt u (mcv H) trhs w r ∧ dt u (mcv H) ⟨ kc_app , te4 +: tmj +: ∅ ⟩ w r ∈ dt u (mcv H) ⟨ kc_app , tT0 +: tmj +: ∅ ⟩ w r $ by ex_elim [l514, l513]
l516: $ G , x1 = nvf' ti , x2 = nvf' tc , x3 = nvf' tk , x4 = (ixs td w (ifam u (dnf u (mcv H)) td w)) , x5 = nvf' tio , x6 = ⟨ kc_ind_ty , td +: ti +: ∅ ⟩ , x7 = ⟨ kc_s , ti +: ∅ ⟩ , ra_closed d tK0 ∈ lrel ∧ nvf' d = nvf' tnp + nvf' tn ⇒ dt u (mcv H) ⟨ kc_app , te4 +: tmj +: ∅ ⟩ w r = dt u (mcv H) trhs w r ∧ dt u (mcv H) ⟨ kc_app , te4 +: tmj +: ∅ ⟩ w r ∈ dt u (mcv H) ⟨ kc_app , tT0 +: tmj +: ∅ ⟩ w r $ by ex_elim [l242, l515]
l517: $ G , x1 = nvf' ti , x2 = nvf' tc , x3 = nvf' tk , x4 = (ixs td w (ifam u (dnf u (mcv H)) td w)) , x5 = nvf' tio , x6 = ⟨ kc_ind_ty , td +: ti +: ∅ ⟩ , x7 = ⟨ kc_s , ti +: ∅ ⟩ ⇒ dt u (mcv H) ⟨ kc_app , te4 +: tmj +: ∅ ⟩ w r = dt u (mcv H) trhs w r ∧ dt u (mcv H) ⟨ kc_app , te4 +: tmj +: ∅ ⟩ w r ∈ dt u (mcv H) ⟨ kc_app , tT0 +: tmj +: ∅ ⟩ w r $ by ex_elim [l225, l516]
l518: $ G , x1 = nvf' ti , x2 = nvf' tc , x3 = nvf' tk , x4 = (ixs td w (ifam u (dnf u (mcv H)) td w)) , x5 = nvf' tio , x6 = ⟨ kc_ind_ty , td +: ti +: ∅ ⟩ ⇒ isset ⟨ kc_s , ti +: ∅ ⟩ $ by opair_isset
l519: $ G , x1 = nvf' ti , x2 = nvf' tc , x3 = nvf' tk , x4 = (ixs td w (ifam u (dnf u (mcv H)) td w)) , x5 = nvf' tio , x6 = ⟨ kc_ind_ty , td +: ti +: ∅ ⟩ ⇒ dt u (mcv H) ⟨ kc_app , te4 +: tmj +: ∅ ⟩ w r = dt u (mcv H) trhs w r ∧ dt u (mcv H) ⟨ kc_app , te4 +: tmj +: ∅ ⟩ w r ∈ dt u (mcv H) ⟨ kc_app , tT0 +: tmj +: ∅ ⟩ w r $ by isset_elim [l518, l517]
