lemma fci14_ct_all (G: hyps) : $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ fci14_ct_q  $
----
l1: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ fci14_ct_q  , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , y ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ctx , x ∊ trees ω ⇒ crn x9 ⊆ fci14_ct_q  $ by ax
l2: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ fci14_ct_q  , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , y ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ctx , x ∊ trees ω ⇒ y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ $ by ax
l3: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ fci14_ct_q  , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , y ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ctx , x ∊ trees ω ⇒ x8 ∊ ω $ by ax
l4: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ fci14_ct_q  , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , y ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ctx , x ∊ trees ω ⇒ x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by ax
l5: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ fci14_ct_q  , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , y ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ctx , x ∊ trees ω ⇒ y ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ctx $ by ax
l6: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ fci14_ct_q  , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , y ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ctx , x ∊ trees ω ⇒ x ∊ trees ω $ by ax
