lemma fci22_pe_all (G: hyps) (tX tY: set): $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ fci22_pe_q tX tY $
----
l1: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ fci22_pe_q tX tY , v = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , ra_pargs tX d k v ∈ lrel , ra_pargs tY d k e ∈ lrel , v ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr , tY ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr ⇒ crn x9 ⊆ fci22_pe_q tX tY $ by ax
