l15: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ fci22_pe_q tX tY , v = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⇒ ∀ k ∀ e (ra_pargs tX d k v ∈ lrel → ra_pargs tY d k e ∈ lrel → v ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr → tY ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr → e ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr) $ by all_intro [l14]
