l30: $ … ⇒ Cf $ by ex_elim [l29, l28]
l31: $ G , H , ∃ qC2 ∃ qT ∃ qi_v (t1 = ⟨ kc_tcons , qF2 +: qC2 +: qT +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , qi_v +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x ∧ t4 = y ∧ ra_nth_ty qT qi_v x y ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ qC2 ∃ qT ∃ qi_v (t1 = ⟨ kc_tcons , qF2 +: qC2 +: qT +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , qi_v +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x ∧ t4 = y ∧ ra_nth_ty qT qi_v x y ∈ lrel) $ by ax
l32: $ … ⇒ Cf $ by ex_elim [l31, l30]
l33: $ G , H , ∃ y ∃ qC2 ∃ qT ∃ qi_v (t1 = ⟨ kc_tcons , qF2 +: qC2 +: qT +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , qi_v +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x ∧ t4 = y ∧ ra_nth_ty qT qi_v x y ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ y ∃ qC2 ∃ qT ∃ qi_v (t1 = ⟨ kc_tcons , qF2 +: qC2 +: qT +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , qi_v +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x ∧ t4 = y ∧ ra_nth_ty qT qi_v x y ∈ lrel) $ by ax
