l3: $ G , ra_ind_data td b p t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen p x1 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys t n m ∈ lrel ∧ ra_motives td x1 tv ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t c ∈ lrel ∧ ra_minors td x1 n ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty t ti e o ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor o tc x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_minor_idx t ti tc k ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis x3 f ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add f m a ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x2 ⟨ kc_s , k +: ∅ ⟩ a ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , x2 +: ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ f x4 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_rwalk td x1 n m tv f ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lams d x5 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lams c x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lams p x7 tR ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_motives td x1 tv ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t c ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_l [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [l1]]]]
