l161: $ G , vk = ⟨ kc_s , n +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ty = ⟨ kc_app , f +: ⟨ kc_bvar , vd +: ∅ ⟩ +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_pargs tH ⟨ kc_s , vd +: ∅ ⟩ n f ∈ lrel , vk = ⟨ kc_s , x1 +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ty = ⟨ kc_app , x2 +: x3 +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ve = ⟨ kc_app , x4 +: x3 +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_rehead tH tX x1 x2 x4 ∈ lrel , x5 = ⟨ kc_s , vd +: ∅ ⟩ ⇒ crn (tH +: ⟨ kc_s , vd +: ∅ ⟩ +: n +: f +: ∅) ⊆ trees ω $ by fseq_crn_c [and_elim_r [l160]]
