--| @freshen G x4
lemma fci25_pv_n {z x1 x2 x3 x4: set} (G: hyps) (M: class) (u w r tD tN tX: set) (ty k1 j1 vd vk: set): $ G ⇒ crn j1 ⊆ fci25_pv_q M u w r tD tN tX $ > $ G ⇒ ty = ⟨ k1 , j1 ⟩ $ > $ G ⇒ k1 ∊ ω $ > $ G ⇒ j1 ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ > $ G ⇒ ra_pargs tX vd vk ty ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ r ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ ∀ z (ra_rst tD tN tX z ∈ lrel → dt u M z w r = dt u M tX w r) $ > $ G ⇒ ∀ x1 ∀ x2 (ra_spine x1 tX x2 ∈ lrel → ¬ ∃ x3 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ty , tD +: x3 +: ∅ ⟩) ∧ ¬ ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , tD +: x3 +: x4 +: ∅ ⟩)) $ > $ G ⇒ ∀ z (ra_rst tD tN ty z ∈ lrel → dt u M z w r = dt u M ty w r) ∧ ∀ x1 ∀ x2 (ra_spine x1 ty x2 ∈ lrel → ¬ ∃ x3 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ty , tD +: x3 +: ∅ ⟩) ∧ ¬ ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , tD +: x3 +: x4 +: ∅ ⟩)) $
