l11: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ fci25_pv_q M u w r tD tN tX , v = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , ra_pargs tX d k v ∈ lrel , w ∊ lvals , r ∊ fseq u , ∀ z (ra_rst tD tN tX z ∈ lrel → dt u M z w r = dt u M tX w r) ⇒ ∀ x1 ∀ x2 (ra_spine x1 tX x2 ∈ lrel → ¬ ∃ x3 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ty , tD +: x3 +: ∅ ⟩) ∧ ¬ ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , tD +: x3 +: x4 +: ∅ ⟩)) → ∀ z (ra_rst tD tN v z ∈ lrel → dt u M z w r = dt u M v w r) ∧ ∀ x1 ∀ x2 (ra_spine x1 v x2 ∈ lrel → ¬ ∃ x3 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ty , tD +: x3 +: ∅ ⟩) ∧ ¬ ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , tD +: x3 +: x4 +: ∅ ⟩)) $ by imp_intro [l10]
l12: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ fci25_pv_q M u w r tD tN tX , v = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , ra_pargs tX d k v ∈ lrel , w ∊ lvals , r ∊ fseq u ⇒ ∀ z (ra_rst tD tN tX z ∈ lrel → dt u M z w r = dt u M tX w r) → ∀ x1 ∀ x2 (ra_spine x1 tX x2 ∈ lrel → ¬ ∃ x3 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ty , tD +: x3 +: ∅ ⟩) ∧ ¬ ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , tD +: x3 +: x4 +: ∅ ⟩)) → ∀ z (ra_rst tD tN v z ∈ lrel → dt u M z w r = dt u M v w r) ∧ ∀ x1 ∀ x2 (ra_spine x1 v x2 ∈ lrel → ¬ ∃ x3 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ty , tD +: x3 +: ∅ ⟩) ∧ ¬ ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , tD +: x3 +: x4 +: ∅ ⟩)) $ by imp_intro [l11]
l13: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ fci25_pv_q M u w r tD tN tX , v = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , ra_pargs tX d k v ∈ lrel , w ∊ lvals ⇒ r ∊ fseq u → ∀ z (ra_rst tD tN tX z ∈ lrel → dt u M z w r = dt u M tX w r) → ∀ x1 ∀ x2 (ra_spine x1 tX x2 ∈ lrel → ¬ ∃ x3 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ty , tD +: x3 +: ∅ ⟩) ∧ ¬ ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , tD +: x3 +: x4 +: ∅ ⟩)) → ∀ z (ra_rst tD tN v z ∈ lrel → dt u M z w r = dt u M v w r) ∧ ∀ x1 ∀ x2 (ra_spine x1 v x2 ∈ lrel → ¬ ∃ x3 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ty , tD +: x3 +: ∅ ⟩) ∧ ¬ ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , tD +: x3 +: x4 +: ∅ ⟩)) $ by imp_intro [l12]
l14: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ fci25_pv_q M u w r tD tN tX , v = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , ra_pargs tX d k v ∈ lrel ⇒ w ∊ lvals → r ∊ fseq u → ∀ z (ra_rst tD tN tX z ∈ lrel → dt u M z w r = dt u M tX w r) → ∀ x1 ∀ x2 (ra_spine x1 tX x2 ∈ lrel → ¬ ∃ x3 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ty , tD +: x3 +: ∅ ⟩) ∧ ¬ ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , tD +: x3 +: x4 +: ∅ ⟩)) → ∀ z (ra_rst tD tN v z ∈ lrel → dt u M z w r = dt u M v w r) ∧ ∀ x1 ∀ x2 (ra_spine x1 v x2 ∈ lrel → ¬ ∃ x3 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ty , tD +: x3 +: ∅ ⟩) ∧ ¬ ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , tD +: x3 +: x4 +: ∅ ⟩)) $ by imp_intro [l13]
l15: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ fci25_pv_q M u w r tD tN tX , v = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⇒ ra_pargs tX d k v ∈ lrel → w ∊ lvals → r ∊ fseq u → ∀ z (ra_rst tD tN tX z ∈ lrel → dt u M z w r = dt u M tX w r) → ∀ x1 ∀ x2 (ra_spine x1 tX x2 ∈ lrel → ¬ ∃ x3 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ty , tD +: x3 +: ∅ ⟩) ∧ ¬ ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , tD +: x3 +: x4 +: ∅ ⟩)) → ∀ z (ra_rst tD tN v z ∈ lrel → dt u M z w r = dt u M v w r) ∧ ∀ x1 ∀ x2 (ra_spine x1 v x2 ∈ lrel → ¬ ∃ x3 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ty , tD +: x3 +: ∅ ⟩) ∧ ¬ ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , tD +: x3 +: x4 +: ∅ ⟩)) $ by imp_intro [l14]
l16: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ fci25_pv_q M u w r tD tN tX , v = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⇒ ∀ k (ra_pargs tX d k v ∈ lrel → w ∊ lvals → r ∊ fseq u → ∀ z (ra_rst tD tN tX z ∈ lrel → dt u M z w r = dt u M tX w r) → ∀ x1 ∀ x2 (ra_spine x1 tX x2 ∈ lrel → ¬ ∃ x3 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ty , tD +: x3 +: ∅ ⟩) ∧ ¬ ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , tD +: x3 +: x4 +: ∅ ⟩)) → ∀ z (ra_rst tD tN v z ∈ lrel → dt u M z w r = dt u M v w r) ∧ ∀ x1 ∀ x2 (ra_spine x1 v x2 ∈ lrel → ¬ ∃ x3 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ty , tD +: x3 +: ∅ ⟩) ∧ ¬ ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , tD +: x3 +: x4 +: ∅ ⟩))) $ by all_intro [l15]
l17: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ fci25_pv_q M u w r tD tN tX , v = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⇒ ∀ d ∀ k (ra_pargs tX d k v ∈ lrel → w ∊ lvals → r ∊ fseq u → ∀ z (ra_rst tD tN tX z ∈ lrel → dt u M z w r = dt u M tX w r) → ∀ x1 ∀ x2 (ra_spine x1 tX x2 ∈ lrel → ¬ ∃ x3 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ty , tD +: x3 +: ∅ ⟩) ∧ ¬ ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , tD +: x3 +: x4 +: ∅ ⟩)) → ∀ z (ra_rst tD tN v z ∈ lrel → dt u M z w r = dt u M v w r) ∧ ∀ x1 ∀ x2 (ra_spine x1 v x2 ∈ lrel → ¬ ∃ x3 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ty , tD +: x3 +: ∅ ⟩) ∧ ¬ ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (x1 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , tD +: x3 +: x4 +: ∅ ⟩))) $ by all_intro [l16]
