l22: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ fci25_pv_q M u w r tD tN tX ⇒ ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ∈ fci25_pv_q M u w r tD tN tX $ by isset_elim [l21, l20]
