l206: $ G , tl = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: tfi +: j +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_ind_data td b x1 t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys t n m ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty t ti x4 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor e ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ k ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis k f ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst td ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ n x2 k x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_psplit f x5 ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp x3 x1 tg ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , td +: ti +: ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ +: ∅ ⟩ f x2 c ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs c ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ f j ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add tk ⟨ kc_s , tfi +: ∅ ⟩ f ∈ lrel , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , x7 = ∅ , xx4 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , td +: ti +: ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ +: ∅ ⟩ , ra_add n x2 a ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed a k ∈ lrel , ra_spine ⟨ kc_ind_ty , td +: ti +: ∅ ⟩ x6 y ∈ lrel , x8 ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) x1 w ∧ x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u (mcv H) x8) x3 w ∧ r = x9 ++ x8 ⇒ ra_pargs c z f j ∈ lrel $ by wcel_eq_l [ra_pargs_eq [l200, eq_sym [l203], l198, l205], l204]
