l315: $ G , tl = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: tfi +: j +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_ind_data td b x1 t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys t n m ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty t ti x4 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor e ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ k ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis k f ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst td ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ n x2 k x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_psplit f x5 ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp x3 x1 tg ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , td +: ti +: ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ +: ∅ ⟩ f x2 c ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs c ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ f j ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add tk ⟨ kc_s , tfi +: ∅ ⟩ f ∈ lrel , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , x7 = ∅ , xx4 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , td +: ti +: ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ +: ∅ ⟩ , ra_add n x2 a ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed a k ∈ lrel , ra_spine ⟨ kc_ind_ty , td +: ti +: ∅ ⟩ x6 y ∈ lrel , x8 ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) x1 w ∧ x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u (mcv H) x8) x3 w ∧ r = x9 ++ x8 , ra_spine xx4 j v ∈ lrel ⇒ x9 ++ x8 ++ x7 = r $ by eq_trans [scat_eq [l313, l312], eq_sym [l314]]
l316: $ G , tl = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: tfi +: j +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_ind_data td b x1 t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys t n m ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty t ti x4 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor e ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ k ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis k f ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst td ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ n x2 k x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_psplit f x5 ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp x3 x1 tg ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , td +: ti +: ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ +: ∅ ⟩ f x2 c ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs c ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ f j ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add tk ⟨ kc_s , tfi +: ∅ ⟩ f ∈ lrel , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , x7 = ∅ , xx4 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , td +: ti +: ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ +: ∅ ⟩ , ra_add n x2 a ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed a k ∈ lrel , ra_spine ⟨ kc_ind_ty , td +: ti +: ∅ ⟩ x6 y ∈ lrel , x8 ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) x1 w ∧ x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u (mcv H) x8) x3 w ∧ r = x9 ++ x8 , ra_spine xx4 j v ∈ lrel ⇒ u = u $ by eq_refl
l317: $ G , tl = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: tfi +: j +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_ind_data td b x1 t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys t n m ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty t ti x4 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor e ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ k ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis k f ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst td ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ n x2 k x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_psplit f x5 ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp x3 x1 tg ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , td +: ti +: ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ +: ∅ ⟩ f x2 c ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs c ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ f j ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add tk ⟨ kc_s , tfi +: ∅ ⟩ f ∈ lrel , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , x7 = ∅ , xx4 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , td +: ti +: ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ +: ∅ ⟩ , ra_add n x2 a ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed a k ∈ lrel , ra_spine ⟨ kc_ind_ty , td +: ti +: ∅ ⟩ x6 y ∈ lrel , x8 ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) x1 w ∧ x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u (mcv H) x8) x3 w ∧ r = x9 ++ x8 , ra_spine xx4 j v ∈ lrel ⇒ (mcv H) = (mcv H) $ by eq_refl
l318: $ G , tl = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: tfi +: j +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_ind_data td b x1 t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys t n m ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty t ti x4 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor e ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ k ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis k f ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst td ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ n x2 k x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_psplit f x5 ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp x3 x1 tg ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , td +: ti +: ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ +: ∅ ⟩ f x2 c ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs c ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ f j ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add tk ⟨ kc_s , tfi +: ∅ ⟩ f ∈ lrel , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , x7 = ∅ , xx4 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , td +: ti +: ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ +: ∅ ⟩ , ra_add n x2 a ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed a k ∈ lrel , ra_spine ⟨ kc_ind_ty , td +: ti +: ∅ ⟩ x6 y ∈ lrel , x8 ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) x1 w ∧ x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u (mcv H) x8) x3 w ∧ r = x9 ++ x8 , ra_spine xx4 j v ∈ lrel ⇒ z1 = z1 $ by eq_refl
l319: $ G , tl = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: tfi +: j +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_ind_data td b x1 t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys t n m ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty t ti x4 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor e ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ k ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis k f ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst td ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ n x2 k x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_psplit f x5 ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp x3 x1 tg ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , td +: ti +: ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ +: ∅ ⟩ f x2 c ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs c ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ f j ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add tk ⟨ kc_s , tfi +: ∅ ⟩ f ∈ lrel , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , x7 = ∅ , xx4 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , td +: ti +: ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ +: ∅ ⟩ , ra_add n x2 a ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed a k ∈ lrel , ra_spine ⟨ kc_ind_ty , td +: ti +: ∅ ⟩ x6 y ∈ lrel , x8 ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) x1 w ∧ x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u (mcv H) x8) x3 w ∧ r = x9 ++ x8 , ra_spine xx4 j v ∈ lrel ⇒ w = w $ by eq_refl
l320: $ G , tl = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: tfi +: j +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_ind_data td b x1 t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys t n m ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty t ti x4 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor e ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ k ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis k f ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst td ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ n x2 k x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_psplit f x5 ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp x3 x1 tg ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , td +: ti +: ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ +: ∅ ⟩ f x2 c ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs c ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ f j ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add tk ⟨ kc_s , tfi +: ∅ ⟩ f ∈ lrel , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , x7 = ∅ , xx4 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , td +: ti +: ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ +: ∅ ⟩ , ra_add n x2 a ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed a k ∈ lrel , ra_spine ⟨ kc_ind_ty , td +: ti +: ∅ ⟩ x6 y ∈ lrel , x8 ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) x1 w ∧ x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u (mcv H) x8) x3 w ∧ r = x9 ++ x8 , ra_spine xx4 j v ∈ lrel ⇒ tl = tl $ by eq_refl
l321: $ G , tl = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: tfi +: j +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_ind_data td b x1 t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys t n m ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty t ti x4 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor e ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ k ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis k f ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst td ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ n x2 k x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_psplit f x5 ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp x3 x1 tg ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , td +: ti +: ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ +: ∅ ⟩ f x2 c ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs c ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ f j ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add tk ⟨ kc_s , tfi +: ∅ ⟩ f ∈ lrel , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , x7 = ∅ , xx4 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , td +: ti +: ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ +: ∅ ⟩ , ra_add n x2 a ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed a k ∈ lrel , ra_spine ⟨ kc_ind_ty , td +: ti +: ∅ ⟩ x6 y ∈ lrel , x8 ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) x1 w ∧ x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u (mcv H) x8) x3 w ∧ r = x9 ++ x8 , ra_spine xx4 j v ∈ lrel ⇒ dt u (mcv H) z1 w r = dt u (mcv H) tl w r $ by eq_trans [eq_sym [dt_eq [l316, l317, l318, l319, l315]], eq_trans [l308, dt_eq [l316, l317, l320, l319, l315]]]
l322: $ G , tl = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: tfi +: j +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_ind_data td b x1 t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys t n m ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty t ti x4 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor e ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ k ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis k f ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst td ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ n x2 k x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_psplit f x5 ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp x3 x1 tg ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , td +: ti +: ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ +: ∅ ⟩ f x2 c ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs c ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ f j ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add tk ⟨ kc_s , tfi +: ∅ ⟩ f ∈ lrel , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , x7 = ∅ , xx4 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , td +: ti +: ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ +: ∅ ⟩ , ra_add n x2 a ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed a k ∈ lrel , ra_spine ⟨ kc_ind_ty , td +: ti +: ∅ ⟩ x6 y ∈ lrel , x8 ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) x1 w ∧ x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u (mcv H) x8) x3 w ∧ r = x9 ++ x8 , ra_spine xx4 j v ∈ lrel ⇒ tl = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: tfi +: j +: ∅ ⟩ $ by weaken [l16]
l323: $ G , tl = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: tfi +: j +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_ind_data td b x1 t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys t n m ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty t ti x4 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor e ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ k ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis k f ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst td ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ n x2 k x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_psplit f x5 ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp x3 x1 tg ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , td +: ti +: ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ +: ∅ ⟩ f x2 c ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs c ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ f j ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add tk ⟨ kc_s , tfi +: ∅ ⟩ f ∈ lrel , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , x7 = ∅ , xx4 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , td +: ti +: ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ +: ∅ ⟩ , ra_add n x2 a ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed a k ∈ lrel , ra_spine ⟨ kc_ind_ty , td +: ti +: ∅ ⟩ x6 y ∈ lrel , x8 ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) x1 w ∧ x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u (mcv H) x8) x3 w ∧ r = x9 ++ x8 , ra_spine xx4 j v ∈ lrel ⇒ r = r $ by eq_refl
l324: $ G , tl = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: tfi +: j +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_ind_data td b x1 t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys t n m ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty t ti x4 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor e ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ k ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis k f ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst td ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ n x2 k x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_psplit f x5 ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp x3 x1 tg ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , td +: ti +: ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ +: ∅ ⟩ f x2 c ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs c ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ f j ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add tk ⟨ kc_s , tfi +: ∅ ⟩ f ∈ lrel , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , x7 = ∅ , xx4 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , td +: ti +: ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ +: ∅ ⟩ , ra_add n x2 a ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed a k ∈ lrel , ra_spine ⟨ kc_ind_ty , td +: ti +: ∅ ⟩ x6 y ∈ lrel , x8 ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) x1 w ∧ x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u (mcv H) x8) x3 w ∧ r = x9 ++ x8 , ra_spine xx4 j v ∈ lrel ⇒ dt u (mcv H) tl w r = dt u (mcv H) ⟨ kc_proj , b +: tfi +: j +: ∅ ⟩ w r $ by dt_eq [l316, l317, l322, l319, l323]
l325: $ G , tl = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: tfi +: j +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_ind_data td b x1 t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys t n m ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty t ti x4 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor e ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ k ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis k f ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst td ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ n x2 k x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_psplit f x5 ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp x3 x1 tg ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , td +: ti +: ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ +: ∅ ⟩ f x2 c ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs c ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ f j ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add tk ⟨ kc_s , tfi +: ∅ ⟩ f ∈ lrel , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , x7 = ∅ , xx4 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , td +: ti +: ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ +: ∅ ⟩ , ra_add n x2 a ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed a k ∈ lrel , ra_spine ⟨ kc_ind_ty , td +: ti +: ∅ ⟩ x6 y ∈ lrel , x8 ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) x1 w ∧ x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u (mcv H) x8) x3 w ∧ r = x9 ++ x8 , ra_spine xx4 j v ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_lookup tg1 tk tT ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#9]
l326: $ G , tl = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: tfi +: j +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_ind_data td b x1 t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys t n m ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty t ti x4 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor e ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ k ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis k f ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst td ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ n x2 k x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_psplit f x5 ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp x3 x1 tg ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , td +: ti +: ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ +: ∅ ⟩ f x2 c ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs c ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ f j ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add tk ⟨ kc_s , tfi +: ∅ ⟩ f ∈ lrel , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , x7 = ∅ , xx4 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , td +: ti +: ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ +: ∅ ⟩ , ra_add n x2 a ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed a k ∈ lrel , ra_spine ⟨ kc_ind_ty , td +: ti +: ∅ ⟩ x6 y ∈ lrel , x8 ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) x1 w ∧ x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u (mcv H) x8) x3 w ∧ r = x9 ++ x8 , ra_spine xx4 j v ∈ lrel ⇒ ⟨ kr_lookup , tg1 +: tk +: tT +: ∅ ⟩ ∈ latoms $ by lrel_latoms [l325]
