l0: $ leqv (limax u lz) lz $ by limax_zero
l2: $ deq G (srt (limax u lz)) (srt lz) (srt (ls (limax u lz))) $ by sortDF [l0]
l3: $ deq G (pi A B) (pi A B) (srt lz) $ by defeqDF [l2, l1]

